    },
    {
      "text": "Some sets add a third ring.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "Three rings",
        "sub": "In some sets"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The rings usually share a metal, so they look like a pair.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "photo",
        "src": "mix585-render-three-quarter.webp",
        "label": "The same metal",
        "focus": {
          "x": 0.45,
          "y": 0.45,
          "k": 1.5
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The same metal also wears evenly where the rings rub.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "photo",
        "src": "mix585-render-side.webp",
        "label": "Where they touch",
        "focus": {
          "x": 0.5,
          "y": 0.55,
          "k": 1.6
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Some couples mix metals on purpose.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "Mixed metals",
        "sub": "On purpose"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The wedding band often curves to fit around the center stone.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "photo",
        "src": "mix585-render-three-quarter.webp",
        "label": "A curved band",
        "focus": {
          "x": 0.42,
          "y": 0.4,
          "k": 2.2
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "That shape is called a contour band, or a curved band.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "photo",
        "src": "mix585-render-top.webp",
        "label": "A contour band",
        "focus": {
          "x": 0.5,
          "y": 0.65,
          "k": 1.6
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "It sits flush against the ring, with no gap between them.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "photo",
        "src": "mix585-render-top.webp",
        "label": "No gap",
        "focus": {
          "x": 0.5,
          "y": 0.72,
          "k": 2.2
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tradition puts the wedding band on first, closest to the heart.",
